    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/b8f7c7ecf5d16391fd8bbe11b11219c0.avif?t=1748370493\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Born into a world without hope, you found a way to survive. Now you have to find your life's meaning in the darkness, and discover the secrets that lay beyond the edges of this world. Muster the courage to find the truth, on a path filled with trials and dangers spanning multiple realities, and who knows - you may end up saving more just your civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warped Times is a 3D adventure platformer taking place between worlds. Discover new environments full of puzzles, bosses to beat, and unexpected revelations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Begin your own adventure of discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your story begins in a dystopian city that has lost its faith. As you attempt to get everything back on track, you will discover hidden secrets, meet other characters seeking the truth, and face your biggest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/8a151c84310ed63f839353340f364485.poster.avif?t=1748370493\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/8a151c84310ed63f839353340f364485.webm?t=1748370493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/8a151c84310ed63f839353340f364485.mp4?t=1748370493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visit unique environments across worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each world has its own distinct atmosphere, and comes with original gameplay elements and bosses that will challenge you in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/bb0861aa1e6be7a439135182eac3d8f9.avif?t=1748370493\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover the powers of the Stone of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember the long-forgtten powers that give you control over space and time. But be careful - you may awaken something more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/2ea70a31ccb2509e6c4bc33cb29bfd2b.poster.avif?t=1748370493\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/2ea70a31ccb2509e6c4bc33cb29bfd2b.webm?t=1748370493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/2ea70a31ccb2509e6c4bc33cb29bfd2b.mp4?t=1748370493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stronger together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not alone on your journey - you will meet allies across time and space, who seek the truth just like you. Sometimes it won't be easy, but one thing is for sure - you will not be alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/64072425b3bbb4996696b93dac8180c4.avif?t=1748370493\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Warped Times is currently in development, with a planned release date in 2026. In the meantime, you can follow our blog, and start getting prepared for a magnificent journey throughout alternative realities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/b8f7c7ecf5d16391fd8bbe11b11219c0.avif?t=1748370493\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Born into a world without hope, you found a way to survive. Now you have to find your life's meaning in the darkness, and discover the secrets that lay beyond the edges of this world. Muster the courage to find the truth, on a path filled with trials and dangers spanning multiple realities, and who knows - you may end up saving more just your civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warped Times is a 3D adventure platformer taking place between worlds. Discover new environments full of puzzles, bosses to beat, and unexpected revelations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Begin your own adventure of discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your story begins in a dystopian city that has lost its faith. As you attempt to get everything back on track, you will discover hidden secrets, meet other characters seeking the truth, and face your biggest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/8a151c84310ed63f839353340f364485.poster.avif?t=1748370493\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/8a151c84310ed63f839353340f364485.webm?t=1748370493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/8a151c84310ed63f839353340f364485.mp4?t=1748370493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visit unique environments across worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each world has its own distinct atmosphere, and comes with original gameplay elements and bosses that will challenge you in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/bb0861aa1e6be7a439135182eac3d8f9.avif?t=1748370493\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover the powers of the Stone of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember the long-forgtten powers that give you control over space and time. But be careful - you may awaken something more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/2ea70a31ccb2509e6c4bc33cb29bfd2b.poster.avif?t=1748370493\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/2ea70a31ccb2509e6c4bc33cb29bfd2b.webm?t=1748370493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/2ea70a31ccb2509e6c4bc33cb29bfd2b.mp4?t=1748370493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stronger together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not alone on your journey - you will meet allies across time and space, who seek the truth just like you. Sometimes it won't be easy, but one thing is for sure - you will not be alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657240/extras/64072425b3bbb4996696b93dac8180c4.avif?t=1748370493\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Warped Times is currently in development, with a planned release date in 2026. In the meantime, you can follow our blog, and start getting prepared for a magnificent journey throughout alternative realities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
